  "title": "Canopy Growth Relaunches Tweed Brand in Germany with New MTL Cannabis Strain Lineup, Marking First International Release Following Acquisition",
  "summary": "Pablo’s Revenge, Dante’z Inferno, and Frost’d Flakes launched under Tweed brand Up to five additional strains expected to follow in June 2026 Company targeting rapid growth in Germany’s medical cannabis market SMITH FALLS, ON – May 29, 2026 – Canopy Growth Corporation (“Canopy Growth” or the “Company”) (TSX: WEED) (Nasdaq: CGC) today announced the relaunch of the Tweed brand in the German medical market, alongside the introduction of three cannabis strains developed by MTL Cannabis Corp. (“MTL”), a wholly-owned…",
